# Resource-free repository (playbook R1): no copied game binaries are EVER
# committed. The surviving builds live in a private sibling / the j2me home's
# _resources/ and are materialized into git-ignored _originals/ by fetch.py.
#
# Match ignored paths BY NAME — no trailing-slash globs — so a stray symlink is
# covered too (playbook R2 — the stalker _originals symlink hazard).

# Immutable surviving distributions (materialized; never committed).
_originals

# Generated catalogs, fingerprints, decompiles, captures (regenerable).
_reference
_temp

# Rust build output.
/target

# Node / web.
node_modules
web/_public
web/_dist
web/.astro

# Python / editor / OS noise.
__pycache__
*.pyc
.DS_Store
*.swp
